/** A claim as the screen sees it: the amount with two decimals, the date as yyyy-MM-dd, the status by name, the number (null when it has none), the due fixed on settling (null when it has none), who opened it (null when never opened), whether its person's last statement bound it, the figure it bound (null when it has none) the number a correction corrects (null for any other claim) and the date it is due by, as yyyy-MM-dd, its status log, oldest first (empty when not listed with it), and the date it was deferred to, as yyyy-MM-dd (null when never deferred), and how many proofs it has been given, and the number of the claim it was split off (null for any other claim), and the user whose open editor locks it (null when not locked), and whether it was added while its period was soft-closed, and the last day it was reminded, as yyyy-MM-dd (null when never reminded), and its external reference (null when it has none), and its tags, sorted (empty for none), and its comments, oldest first, as "user on date: text" (empty when not listed with them). */
